# Analysis script, not a test. It describes the field-coverage page and writes
# Configuration/pages/UsrTestForm.json.
#
# This page carries one control of every supported kind, plus the three grid variants Creatio can
# render, which is what makes it the page the framework is regression-tested against.

use Supervisor
analyse "/0/Shell/#Page/UsrTest_FormPage/edit/71d27c81-3d6b-41d9-9a39-c408c96173b6" UsrTestForm
